	quest.01FEE2B457900E8B.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the complete &3Resonarium&r armor set. Protection falls between Diamond and Netherite, and the set has enchantability to spare."
		""
		"A sensible choice for your first descent into the Otherside, before you can face the &cWarden&r for something finer."
