	quest.023496E8C3F8DCFC.quest_desc: [
		"Individual ME devices can also be configured to respond to &credstone&r signals. When upgraded with a &aRedstone Card&f, a device can be configured to do work only when powered with &credstone&r or otherwise as needed."
		""
		"This behavour can also apply to &nentire&r sections of an &5ME Network&r by using an &0ME Toggle Bus&f."
		""
		"This allows a section of the network on the other side of the bus to come online only when the bus is powered by &credstone&r, or to go offline if using an &eInverted Toggle Bus&r."
	]
	quest.024F7D92830FA581.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Crystal Growth Accelerators&r accelerate crystal growth, which allows you to create &bCertus Quartz Crystal&r and &9Fluix Crystal&r from &ncrystal dust&r."
		""
		"Must be powered by an &dME Network&r via the &ntop&r or &nbottom&r, and consumes a steady &b8 AE&r/t while plugged in."
		""
		"&aCrystal Seeds&r must be in an adjacent water block to be effected, the seeds will shimmer more rapidly when in the presence of a &npowered&r &9Crystal Growth Accelerator&r."
		""
		"Can only connect to cables, or other networked machines on the &ntop&r and &nbottom&r of the machine."
	]
