	quest.275774CED46210EA.quest_desc: [
		"The &eValkyrie Pickaxe&r is a &o&btool unique&r to the &3Silver Dungeon&r."
		"This &o&bPickaxe&r is very useful when it comes to mining blocks from &o&bunder islands&r, as it has a &o&bvery far reach&r, almost &edouble&r the normal reach! It is also quite useful for fighting the &dSlider&r."
		""
		"The &eValkyrie Axe&r is a &o&btool unique&r to the &3Silver Dungeon&r."
		"This &o&bAxe&r has a &o&bvery far reach&r and &o&bvery high attack&r power. You can use this to your advantage, but be &cwarned&r, the &o&battack cooldown&r is very high."
		""
		"The &eValkyrie Shovel&r is a &o&btool unique&r to the &3Silver Dungeon&r."
		"This &o&bShovel&r can help you reach &2Quicksoil&r from a &o&bsafer distance&r."
		""
		"The &eValkyrie Hoe&r is a &o&btool unique&r to the &3Silver Dungeon&r."
		"This &o&bHoe&r has an &o&bincredibly far reach&r, allowing you to &npointlessly&r till dirt from a &o&bsafer distance&r."
	]
	quest.275774CED46210EA.title: "Valkyrie Tools"
	quest.278A4E3A12EA9C4D.quest_desc: [
