	quest.3848DFB51F77997B.quest_desc: [
		"The Wireless Terminal makes it slightly easier to access any Storage Terminals. By right-clicking with one on a Storage Terminal you can access it from distances up to 16 blocks. This will still require the player to actively right click on the Storage Terminal however so line of sight is still required."
