	quest.3BB31C10EB93A4D1.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Sun Spirit&r is a boss found in the &eGold Dungeons&r. "
		""
		"The &6Sun Spirit&r can't be killed by attacking it directly. The way to defeat him is by hitting back the &o&bice crystals&r, he throws on you, at it &nmultiple times&r."
		""
