	quest.6AFB79B3C4DA88BF.quest_desc: [
		"The Advanced Wireless Terminal is essentially an upgraded version of the regular Wireless Terminal. When shift-right-clicking on a Storage Terminal with it you can bind it to that terminal so that when you are within 64 blocks of it you can access it from simply right clicking with the Advanced Wireless Terminal in hand. The range of it can be extended by building higher leveled beacons."
