	quest.7FA718277BA80D96.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Explorer's Compass&r finds structures: temples, dungeons, ruins and more."
	]
	quest.7FA718277BA80D96.title: "Explorer's Compass"
	quest.7FA748818BEA6D4D.quest_desc: [
		"A &bBlank Pattern&r, once encoded as an &eCrafting Patter&rn or &dProcessing Pattern&r, is used to control crafting by inserting them into &6Molecular Assembler&r and &2ME Pattern Provider&r."
		""
		"Encoded version of &bBlank Pattern&r created by using the &2ME Pattern Encoding Terminal&r in \"Crafting Mode\"."
		""
		"Crafting Recipes are very specific, and &nautomatically&r have an output associated with them, these are required to work with a &6Molecular Assembler&r."
		""
		"The description of a crafting pattern starts with \"&nCrafts&r\"."
	]
	quest.7FB4C254337B9599.quest_desc: [
		"Ocean battles await!"
		""
		"Defeat 20 Pokémon in ocean biomes."
		""
		"&6Mid Playtime Quest&r"
	]
	quest.7FB4C254337B9599.title: "Ocean Battler"
	quest.7FDC3D164A882421.quest_desc: [
		"&eFunk City&r is the heart of the server: shops, gyms, the Ranger Station, the Purification Center and the Gadget Garage in the Galleria."
		""
		"Outside the dome lies the &2Wilds&r ring with its eight gates. Rumour has it surveyors left secrets out there..."
	]
	quest.7FDC3D164A882421.title: "Funk City"
	quest.7FEA7959D45D014D.quest_desc: [
		"The &bAether&r is a hostile, paradise-like dimension of &o&bfloating islands&r high in the sky, where you can begin a &o&bnew survival adventure&r packed with &o&bnew ores&r, &o&bmythical creatures&r and perilous &6Dungeons&r."
		""
		"To access the &bAether&r, you must construct an &o&bAether Portal&r in the &aOverworld&r. To create the portal, first build a rectangular &eGlowstone&r frame, ranging in size from a minimum of &o&b4x5&r blocks to a maximum of &o&b23x23&r blocks. Once the frame is built, it can be &o&bactivated&r by placing &9Water&r within the frame using a &9Water Bucket&r, melting a block of &bIce&r inside the frame, or using &3Dispensers&r."
	]
	quest.7FEA7959D45D014D.title: "Visit the &9Aether"
